Legal points, short as I can:
(a) any discount over 8 % on a lane needs the Price Exception form PE-3 with Dieter's countersignature, no exceptions even if Rafał "has the authority", it is the form that counts;
(b) the bands must be PROSPECTIVE, i.e. the discount applies to the boxes after the threshold is crossed, never retroactively to the earlier boxes, otherwise finance has to book a rebate accrual and I have to explain it to the auditors;
(c) the contracting entity is Fruttoria Baltica Sp. z o.o. only. The Lithuanian and Latvian volumes belong to the UAB and SIA entities and are NOT covered, please say so in the addendum;
(d) a fuel cap is acceptable only as a percentage of the leg fee, not as a euro amount. The addendum number is KCC/FB/2024/S1, I have already opened it;
(e) Yusuf: no "I will look at it generously" on the phone. Please. Remember Oakhaven.
